  "notes": "Indonesian restaurant menu, one fixed page inside a double frame. The restaurant name, the \"since 1998\" line and the address/opening-hours line at the bottom are furniture. The menu is set in two columns (CSS grid), read left column top to bottom, then right column. Each menu section is a borderless two-column table (dish, price) with dotted leaders drawn by CSS between them and no header row; the leaders are not text. Prices are in rupiah with a dot as thousands separator. The italic intro and the centred notes are body text."
